      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I must say, i entered many quest worlds, and have never seen crashes or load problems - with Quest 2. (Quest 2 64GB)\nPerhaps re-install VRChat might help? You can also refresh your Quest for once, and then install everyhing. (factory reset)\nSide note: bad made worlds still exists. But if you have examples, i am willing to take a look for you. \nIf other quest friends have no problems, it's your software issue. Then factory reset is good idea, build again up and check.\nAnd it's also possible you have small hardware error. If factory reset wont fix it, i recommend send your Quest back for warranty repair.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
