  "created": "2021-08-08T22:54:10.442Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "As a quest player, it has become really frustrating after the new update. I don't know why it is but most worlds which are supposedly quest wont let me load in anymore and then crashes my system. It feels like I spend more time crashing/loading then I am playing the game.\nAnother issue is that when I eventually load into a world the world is barely there...there have been worlds with no floors or content at all and objects literally entirely black. Writing on signs etc. is also unreadable and blocky. I have seen other posts about mirrors on quest after the recent update to VRC as well and I have the same issue. Mirrors make the whole world turn blacked out and just really hard to use. \nI just really hope this gets fixed because it's sad to see all my friends hanging out in quest worlds so I can be there too however I either spend 30 minutes crashing/loading or sitting in a world that is completely broken. :((",
